'''Jaraco Aerospace Base''' {{Airport codes|JOB|SHJO}} ({{lang-bl|Base Aérea y Espacial de Jaraco}}; '''BAEJ''') is a [[Confederal Aerospace Force]] base in southern [[Araucaria]], in the [[Tukupi]] [[Regions of Balisca|region]]. It is located in the [[Jaraco]] municipality, at the foot of the [[Matarrañya / Cañadapirén]]. 

